1
00:00:00,431 --> 00:00:03,891
I'm a scientist.
I never apologize for the truth.

2
00:00:11,108 --> 00:00:12,988
(Sheldon:)That's my spot.

3
00:00:20,492 --> 00:00:23,992
(Raj:)I can't wait to ask Stan Lee
why he insists on giving his characters...

4
00:00:24,163 --> 00:00:27,163
(Raj:)...first and last names
that start with the same letter.

5
00:00:27,332 --> 00:00:29,502
(Leonard:)Oh, come on. Why would you do that?

6
00:00:29,668 --> 00:00:33,258
(Raj:)Bruce Banner, Reed Richards,
Sue Storm, Stephen Strange...

7
00:00:33,422 --> 00:00:35,882
(Raj:)...Otto Octavius, Silver Surfer,
Peter Parker.

8
00:00:36,049 --> 00:00:41,389
(Raj:)Oh, and worst of all,
J. Jonah Jameson Jr.

9
00:00:42,639 --> 00:00:43,679
(Howard:)Okay, I'm cutting.

10
00:00:43,849 --> 00:00:47,479
(Howard:)I'm not gonna talk to Stan Lee
after you cheese him off.

11
00:00:47,644 --> 00:00:49,644
["SPIDER-MAN" THEME SONG
PLAYING OVER CELL PHONE]

12
00:00:52,524 --> 00:00:54,694
(Leonard:)-Hey.
-Sheldon's in jail.

13
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:59,020
(Leonard:)-Sheldon's in jail?
-You called it.

